Event 16 is the corrupted one. It is a pass from 56.0,4.4 to -9.0,15.2, but the next receipt (event 17) is at 53.3,15.2, so the end point should be about 53.3,15.2. The x-coordinate of -9.0 is also off the pitch.

The listed pass is about 65.9 units long and takes only 0.5 seconds, which is far too fast for a pass that distance. That fits the fast_long_pass corruption type.

{"corrupt": "yes", "index": 16, "type": "fast_long_pass"}
